## Purpose of AI use:
- Save effort / Github Copilot agent / generate basic folder project structure and readme with usage instructions


## A brief description of how generative AI supported my work, with encountered limitations:

Some coding tasks are not very interesting, like implementing a file reader with language X nth time. I havent touched python since 2022 prog1 course so reading about how to do it with python was not very interesting. LLM suggestions can be checked against the Path documentation "these methods really exist and work like that".

In addition to code LLM can generate responses to my ideas and questions, they can be helpful in understanding what my options could be. It would be good to find answers to questions myself by reading documents, books etc. but as a personal limitation I am lazy and cba to do all that every single time.

Another limitation is that LLM usually generates too long responses, they take too long to read, LLM is bad at distilling/summarizing the essential information so it generates a lot of text to cover that.

## About IDE and AI usage:

VSCode was used when developing the program. "chat.disableAIFeatures" was enabled in user settings, so AI did not directly interact with the project.